# NOTICE

This repository is a fork of **@anysearch/anysearch-dsh** (https://github.com/anysearch-team/anysearch-dsh),
licensed under the MIT License. The original copyright notice is preserved in LICENSE.

Changes made in this fork:

- package renamed to `dsh-anysearch-ev` and versioned as `<upstream>-fork.<n>`;
- a browser-half settings card (`src/client/`, `lib/client.js`) was added to configure the
  `ANYSEARCH_API_KEY` credential reference from the DSH Plugins page;
- `dsh.client` / `exports["./client"]` / `manifestVersion` declarations and a client build
  (`scripts/build-client.mjs`) were added;
- `cordis.patch.yml` now points at this package's name;
- CI scripts that referenced the upstream package name were updated accordingly.

The host half (search/fetch providers, tools, validation, tests) is upstream code and is kept
in sync with the original repository through a scheduled GitHub Action.
